\item describe the vibration of effects with \code{\link[=voe]{voe()}}, \code{\link[=janus]{janus()}} and
\code{\link[=volcano]{volcano()}};
\item test the effects jointly across the specifications with \code{\link[=pima]{pima()}},
controlling the FWER.
}
